# The Hand Load stat: under each arm on the Anatomy tab, the heaviest thing that hand can hold.
#
# One stat per arm (RightHandLoadStat, LeftHandLoadStat), read off the arm part's score: 0 light,
# 1 medium, 2 heavy. It is the figure PartyMember.HoldLimit enforces, so what the panel shows is the
# rule. --organs sets the two arms apart so each hand reads its own arm, not the pair.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --organs right_arm=0,left_arm=2

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 45

manage Anatomy
wait 5
point organ right_arm
wait 5
expect Hand Load
expect light
dump

point organ left_arm
wait 5
expect Hand Load
expect heavy
dump

quit
